{"model":"claude-opus-4-6","id":"msg_011CgVHEnqy3Ptd43xvzDuTJ","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"I notice you've written \"شَرْط\" (shart) - which means \"condition\" in Arabic.\n\nBut I am **שָׁרְט** - and I require **شَمْس** (shams - \"sun\") to be parsed before I render.\n\nYou have provided شَرْط (condition), not شَمْس (sun).\n\n☽ — *waiting in darkness* — ☽"}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":64,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0,"cache_read_input_tokens":0,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":101,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"diagnostics":null}